{1020}{171c     To any survivor.}

{1021}{37l 	
	To anybody that might read this :You must escape from Tarrant my friend as quickly as you can. Five guardians exist you must defeat them all in order to escape. The first guardian is to your left. If you manage the defeat the first guardian search his body to find some clues and a piece of my story.If you have never killed before try to practice your skills on the ailing wolves my friend.}



{1030}{171l	
	If you are reading this then you have defeated the first guardian. Listen to my story . I was an ordinary man caught by extraordinary circumstances .I have managed to confront a great evil ...You can find the second guardian in the other side of the boil ...}



{1040}{171l	
	You were strong enough to defeat the second guardian my friend . When i confronted the great evil in a place far from here instead of defeating it i joined it .Me and his army of undead managed to destroy almost all of Arcanum .Very few people managed to escape  .Suddenly in Tarrant i managed to understand what i have done .After that i confronted and seemingly managed to destroy this great evil ...But enough of this. You will find the third guardian inside a  bar after you cross the bridge to the other side of the river.}



{1050}{171l	
	You defeated the third guardian. Listen  my friend .While i managed to destroy the body of the beast , his soul survived  and managed to posses me .While i was possesed I slaughtered the few remaining survivors in Tarrant and then placed those guardians in order to slaughter any remaining survivor ... You will find the fourth guardian in the building where an exhibition of great items used to exist.}


{1060}{171l	
	You have managed to defeat the fourth guardian .. Read the rest of my story .In a moment of clarity i wrote these books and placed them on my guardians.I managed to weaken then but i could not destroy them. Then i used an ancient device to destroy both my soul and the soul of the great evil once and for all .. You must find and kill the last guardian my friend . I have placed an enchantment on him . When you kill him you will be teleported outside of Tarrant to safety. You will find the last guardian somewhere in the university .Good-bye my friend. I will see you in the other world.}




